            "title": "Python code (each .... is one 4-space indent)",
            "text": "a = 10\nb = 3\nprint(a, \"+\", b, \"=\", a + b)    # 10 + 3 = 13\nprint(a, \"//\", b, \"=\", a // b)  # 10 // 3 = 3\nprint(a, \"%\", b, \"=\", a % b)    # 10 % 3 = 1\nprint(a, \"**\", b, \"=\", a ** b)  # 10 ** 3 = 1000"
